# ffximain_inventory.patch
# FFXI 80 -> 120 slot inventory expansion for FFXiMain.dll (UNPACKED, image base 0x10000000).
# Storage (object-relative 121-slot table) + all container-window UIs (main inventory, Mog Safe,
# Satchel/Sack/Case, etc.). See docs/ffximain/inventory.md for the full write-up.
#
# Apply:  xi dll ffximain unpack --output FFXiMain_unpacked.dll
#         xi dll ffximain patch --unpacked FFXiMain_unpacked.dll --patch ffximain_inventory.patch --output FFXiMain_patched.dll
#         xi dll ffximain pack --template FFXiMain.dll --unpacked FFXiMain_patched.dll --output FFXiMain.dll
#
# Format (one edit per line):  <va> <expect_hex> <replace_hex>  ; <note>
#   va          virtual address (image base 0x10000000)
#   expect_hex  bytes that MUST be present before patching (aborts on mismatch)
#   replace_hex bytes to write (same length as expect)
# Lines starting with # are comments. Re-applying is safe: already-patched edits are skipped.
#
# 183 edits, 634 bytes changed. Generated from clean unpack -> fully-patched build.

